{"id":"501951","name":"酸辣汤","author":"沙儿飞飞❉","authorId":"9012879","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/501951/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西红柿","amount":"1个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"金针菇","amount":"1把"},{"name":"豆芽","amount":"1把"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"大葱","amount":"1段"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"辣椒粉","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"水淀粉","amount":"半碗"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"2颗"},{"name":"醋","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备","img":"images/501951/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把西红柿切小块","img":"images/501951/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中倒入少许油、下入葱姜末炒香","img":"images/501951/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"下入西红柿丁炒出汁","img":"images/501951/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入适量清水煮沸","img":"images/501951/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"下入金针菇、豆芽、煮2分钟左右","img":"images/501951/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下入老抽一勺","img":"images/501951/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"醋一勺","img":"images/501951/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"胡椒粉一勺","img":"images/501951/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"适量盐","img":"images/501951/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"下入水淀粉搅拌均匀","img":"images/501951/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"下入鸡蛋液搅拌均匀","img":"images/501951/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"下入辣椒粉、香菜末拌均匀","img":"images/501951/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"天冷来一碗、热乎乎的酸辣汤太棒了~","img":"images/501951/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"水淀粉：红薯粉加水、调稀一点就成了。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}